WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:02,360
How much water is left?

2
00:00:03,970 --> 00:00:04,970
Only this bottle

3
00:00:04,970 --> 00:00:08,300
Captain Lu

4
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:09,300
We still have three bottles of water

5
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:10,300
And ten packs of instant noodles

6
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:13,230
one hundred and forty people

7
00:00:13,230 --> 00:00:15,230
Not even enough for one person to fill a mouthful

8
00:00:15,230 --> 00:00:18,600
Captain Lu

9
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:23,710
What should we do now, boss?

10
00:00:23,710 --> 00:00:25,710
I believe that eldest sister will definitely come to save us

11
00:00:25,710 --> 00:00:28,900
We should never wait for others to come to our rescue, but

12
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:32,560
no exit

13
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:35,170
We dig our own way
